Then the anger of the LORD was kindled against his people, and he abhorred his heritage;

Blessed are they who observe justice, who do righteousness at all times! Remember me, O LORD,when thou showest favor to thy people; help me when thou deliverest them;

Both we and our fathers have sinned;we have committed iniquity, we have done wickedly. Our fathers, when they were in Egypt,did not consider thy wonderful works;they did not remember the abundance of thy steadfast love, but rebelled against the Most High at the Red Sea.

but they mingled with the nations and learned to do as they did. They served their idols, which became a snare to them.

