Trust in the LORD, and do good;so you will dwell in the land, and enjoy security. Take delight in the LORD, and he will give you the desires of your heart.

The LORD knows the days of the blameless, and their heritage will abide for ever; The steps of a man are from the LORD, and he establishes him in whose way he delights;

Depart from evil, and do good; so shall you abide for ever. The righteous shall possess the land, and dwell upon it for ever.

